WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
What is 3 take away 5?

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:04.860
Taking away means stepping left.

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.980
Three steps reach zero, but we still owe two.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.840
So we keep going, past zero.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.016
3 take away 5 is minus 2.
